            "detailed_description": "<strong>No language skills are required to play this game.</strong>\t   <br>\t\t   <br>An unexpected incident has separated a fawn from his family.\t   <br>Now he needs to learn how to take care of himself.\t   <br>He has to pull through a hard time in hopes that he will find his parents again.\t   <br>What is waiting for him in this huge unknown world?\t   <br>What tough calls is he going to face?\t   <br>\t\t   <br>Features of the Game:\t   <br>- the world is divided into different playing areas, depending on the possibility to survive\t   <br>- safe places to take a rest so that you can recover your health \t   <br>- sources of spring water will save you from constant thirst \t   <br>- search for the necessary herb will save you from hunger for a while \t   <br>- stones embracing the full power of nature that bring you back to life \t   <br>- sudden and sometimes even fatal encounters with other dwellers of the world around \t   <br><br>---<br>A piece of advice:<br>Do not come close to the edge.<br>The Deer can not keep the balance and falls.<br>---<br>\t\t   <br>What should you do when you are all alone?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693180/extras/2fced079da0df3e0edb9ceefb782e334.avif?t=1531515507\" width=600 height=200 /></span>",
